{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23345","headline":"荅刘禹锡白太守行 · 白居易","name":"荅刘禹锡白太守行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吏满六百石，昔贤輙去之。\n秩登二千石，今我方罢归。\n我秩讶已多，我归慙已迟。\n犹胜尘土下，终老无休期。\n卧乞百日告，起吟五篇诗。\n朝与府吏别，暮与州民辞。\n去年到郡时，麦穗黄离离。\n今年去郡日，稻花白霏霏。\n爲郡已周岁，半岁罹旱饥。\n襦袴无一片，甘棠无一枝。\n何乃老与幼，泣别尽沾衣。\n下慙苏人泪，上媿刘君辞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23345.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23345","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}